<title>USA: St Paul hogs $0.50 lower - USDA.</title>
<headline>St Paul hogs $0.50 lower - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>ST PAUL 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $0.50 lower. Top $61.00 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3     220-250 lbs    61.00</p>
<p>	     250-260 lbs    60.50-61.00</p>
<p>	     260-270 lbs    59.50-60.50</p>
<p>US 2-3     270-280 lbs    58.50-59.50</p>
<p>Sows: steady to 1.00 higher. Top 49.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3     300-500 lbs    47.50-48.00</p>
<p>	     500-550 lbs    48.00-48.50</p>
<p>	     550-700 lbs    48.50-49.00</p>
</text>
